ne","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ashwin Chopra","text":"It builds on the results of my trials with the macrophages.","speakerId":"AshwinChopra","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"It builds on the results of my trials with the macrophages.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":1200.0,"y":550.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"45860","byteOffset":31681848,"byteLength":368}},{"id":"DFr_F5726B20","articyId":"72057606922868022","type":"choice","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Player","text":"I'm listening.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I'm listening.","TextSheVersion":"I'm listening.","TextTheyVersion":"I'm listening."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":1500.0,"y":550.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"40643","byteOffset":29704336,"byteLength":324}},{"id":"DFr_22C81669","articyId":"72057606922868029","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ashwin Chopra","text":"The disinfectant worked as intended at first. But then the enzymes formed their own organic byproducts.","speakerId":"AshwinChopra","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"The disinfectant worked as intended at first. But then the enzymes formed their own organic byproducts.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":1200.0,"y":300.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"19365","byteOffset":15211176,"byteLength":412}},{"id":"DFr_4163BDFA","articyId":"72057606922868036","type":"choice","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Player","text":"And?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"And?","TextSheVersion":"And?","TextTheyVersion":"And?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":1500.0,"y":300.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"43123","byteOffset":30642936,"byteLength":312}},{"id":"DFr_5F140079","articyId":"72057606922868043","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ashwin Chopra","text":"I'm not gonna lie, there was a... small amount of genetic overproduction. It resulted in a kind of slime. A... sentient slime.","speakerId":"AshwinChopra","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I'm not gonna lie, there was a... small amount of genetic overproduction. It resulted in a kind of slime. A... sentient slime.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":1800.0,"y":300.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"28981","byteOffset":18847128,"byteLength":436}},{"id":"DFr_14EB6650","articyId":"72057606922868050","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ashwin Chopra","text":"Don't get me wrong, the slime wasn't gonna open its own business or start talking politics, but...","speakerId":"AshwinChopra","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Don't get me wrong, the slime wasn't gonna open its own business or start talking politics, but...","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":2100.0,"y":300.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"18759","byteOffset":14983368,"byteLength":444}},{"id":"DFr_19327AAA","articyId":"72057606922868057","type":"choice","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Player","text":"You created a new lifeform!","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"You created a new lifeform!","TextSheVersion":"You created a new lifeform!","TextTheyVersion":"You created a new lifeform!"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":2400.0,"y":300.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"19673","byteOffset":15326320,"byteLength":336}},{"id":"DFr_C963780C","articyId":"72057606922868065","type":"choice","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Player","text":"You made a big mess, didn't you?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"You made a big mess, didn't you?","TextSheVersion":"You made a big mess, didn't you?","TextTheyVersion":"You made a big mess, didn't you?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":2400.0,"y":550.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"21653","byteOffset":16082088,"byteLength":340}},{"id":"DFr_A431E8C7","articyId":"72057606922868072","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ashwin Chopra","text":"Yes, but that's not all bad. Hear me out!","speakerId":"AshwinChopra","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Yes, but that's not all bad. Hear me out!","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":2700.0,"y":300.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"21614","byteOffset":16066968,"byteLength":352}},{"id":"DFr_757EC03E","articyId":"72057606922868079","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ashwin Chopra","text":"My study of the macrophage behavior gave me an idea for something new. Nanobot enzyme hunters!","speakerId":"AshwinChopra","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"My study of the macrophage behavior gave me an idea for something new. Nanobot enzyme hunters!","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":3000.0,"y":300.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"36212","byteOffset":28046416,"byteLength":404}},{"id":"DFr_DA52E1F7","articyId":"72057606922868087","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ashwin Chopra","text":"The macrophages hunt the micro organisms down, then the macrophages start to reproduce and make slimes, the nanobots attack them!","speakerId":"AshwinChopra","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"The macrophages hunt the micro organisms down, then the macrophages start to reproduce and make slimes, the nanobots attack them!","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":3300.0,"y":300.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"38572","byteOffset":28926584,"byteLength":476}},{"id":"DFr_33B35D62","articyId":"72057606922868094","type":"choice","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Player","text":"Could that really work?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Could that really work?","TextSheVersion":"Could that really work?","TextTheyVersion":"Could that really work?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":3600.0,"y":300.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"52352","byteOffset":34219816,"byteLength":332}},{"id":"DFr_8E29A27D","articyId":"72057606922868101","type":"choice","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Player","text":"I worry this nonsense will continue...","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I worry this nonsense will continue...","TextSheVersion":"I worry this nonsense will continue...","TextTheyVersion":"I worry this nonsense will continue..."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":3600.0,"y":550.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"30001","byteOffset":19229688,"byteLength":348}},{"id":"DFr_E442BB69","articyId":"72057606922868108","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ashwin Chopra","text":"Well, I don't think anyone has tried exactly. But general purpose nanobots are cheap and easy to program. I just need to write some basic DNA scanning algorithms.","speakerId":"AshwinChopra","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Well, I don't think anyone has tried exactly. But general purpose nanobots are cheap and easy to program. I just need to write some basic DNA scanning algorithms.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":3900.0,"y":425.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"37176","byteOffset":28405448,"byteLength":472}},{"id":"DFr_C11897A6","articyId":"72057606922868123","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ashwin Chopra","text":"These bots have been used for surgery, so enzyme clean-up should be simple, right? So, what do you think, boss?","speakerId":"AshwinChopra","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"These bots have been used for surgery, so enzyme clean-up should be simple, right? So, what do you think, boss?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":4200.0,"y":425.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"49190","byteOffset":32951744,"byteLength":420}},{"id":"DFr_67099E90","articyId":"72057606922868130","type":"choice","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Player","text":"Let me sleep on it.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Let me sleep on it.","TextSheVersion":"Let me sleep on it.","TextTheyVersion":"Let me sleep on it."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":5100.0,"y":425.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"39341","byteOffset":2